ang-clojure/1795104744000-fixorder-r3-evidence/fixorder-r3-kondo.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795104744000-fixorder-r3-evidence/fixorder-r3-node-order-floats-divergence.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795104744000-fixorder-r3-evidence/fixorder-r3-node-order.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795109079000-engineer-fix-constructed-collection-order-r3.glm-5.3.findings.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795109958000-reviewer-fixorder-r3.gpt-6.2-sol.findings.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/README.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/bbtest.out\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/branch-mergecheck.out\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/daostream.out\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/master-redcheck.out\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795110000000-jupiter-g2-gate-evidence/summary.txt\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795112272000-engineer-fix-constructed-collection-order-r4.glm-5.3.findings.md\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795112272000-fixorder-r4-evidence/fixorder-r4-kondo.log\nA\tcollab/yang-clojure/1795122000000-reviewer-fixorder-r4-confirm.gemini-4-argon-high.findings.md\nM\ttest/resources/yang/clojure/constructed-collections-legacy-c1-1.cbor\nM\ttest/yang/clojure_collection_order_test.cljc\n39562f7c fix(yang): canonical ordering for constructed map/set operands — ruling 1795017757000\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
